WEBVTT

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:45.230
In 2042, the Great 4 was searching

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:48.066
for a form of sustainability
that would benefit all parties.

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:50.527
The American Empire used an AI
named Code 1A84.

00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:54.531
Warfare soon became industrialized
and was dubbed the "sustainable war."

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:57.784
However, the situation turned dire

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:01.288
as each country tried to put
its own economic interests first.

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:05.584
In 2044, a global default froze
the financial institutions.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:08.211
Money became worthless.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:11.632
Cryptocurrency and digital money vanished.

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:15.010
The industrialized warfare
rapidly intensified.

00:02:15.093 --> 00:02:19.306
Riots, terrorism, and civil wars
broke out in developed countries.

00:02:20.223 --> 00:02:22.851
The sustainable war slowly 
but surely spread,

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:25.812
threatening the human race
with distinction.

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:30.734
It is now 2045...

00:03:09.564 --> 00:03:13.485
NO NOISE, NO LIFE - Sustainable War

00:15:08.199 --> 00:15:09.742
ENTRY POINT CALCULATION

00:24:09.448 --> 00:24:11.450
Subtitle translation by Natsuka Koshimi
